And you think;  'Oh, that's a dharma teacher.  That is a real dharma teacher'.

00:04:00.751 --> 00:04:02.900
Or you think of the old image of Nagarjuna,

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:06.739
and he is very mystical.

00:04:07.840 --> 00:04:10.959
In lam rim, what we learn

00:04:11.920 --> 00:04:13.920
is this woman.

00:04:14.799 --> 00:04:17.439
