00:04:18.239 --> 00:04:22.078
and he is a dharma teacher.  He is a real dharma teacher.

00:04:22.639 --> 00:04:27.459
Pabongka Rinpoche said, don't think that a dharma teacher has to sit on a throne

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:30.660
