00:04:34.640 --> 00:04:37.760
He pays taxes.

00:04:38.560 --> 00:04:42.840
Honestly paying your taxes is really hard in my country.

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:46.320
It may take a few weeks to do your taxes and

00:04:46.880 --> 00:04:48.880
to really do them carefully,

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:51.040
to really do them honestly,

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:53.759
to pay every penny that you owe.

00:04:54.400 --> 00:04:56.400
This makes him...

00:04:56.479 --> 00:05:00.639
He has an incredible first training as a good person;

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:02.880
be kind to others.

00:05:02.880 --> 00:05:05.400
That makes him a real dharma teacher.

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:09.920
Forget the 'old' pictures with the big hat you had,

00:05:09.920 --> 00:05:11.700
and the ringing bell.  Okay, that's easy.

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:13.420
