In this part of the lamrin, Pabongka Rinpoche says;

00:11:44.320 --> 00:11:50.660
the place you should spread the dharma is here, in your own heart.

00:11:50.900 --> 00:11:56.160
Don't think that spreading dharma means, trying to translate videos

00:11:56.160 --> 00:12:00.800
into more languages ​​or something like that.  It is a very important way to spread the dharma.

00:12:01.440 --> 00:12:05.240
But he said, if you spread it in your own heart,

00:12:05.920 --> 00:12:09.920
of course it will spread outside of you because this world comes from your heart,

00:12:09.920 --> 00:12:11.519
actually from your heart chakra actually.

