00:25:15.600 --> 00:25:19.180
Feeling annoyed with other people or

00:25:19.600 --> 00:25:24.920
obsessed with getting something or money or

00:25:25.200 --> 00:25:28.080
addicted to Netflix at night.

00:25:28.720 --> 00:25:34.680
.... by the way, it's not wrong to watch Netflix, but I'm talking about

