hurting other people because you want to go home and watch Netflix.  That's a problem.

00:25:43.360 --> 00:25:45.447
This is called a gang fight.

00:25:45.447 --> 00:25:46.959
What's the story?

00:25:50.799 --> 00:25:54.719
Attacking the biggest person on the other side.

00:25:55.520 --> 00:25:57.520
Find out who the leader of the other side is,

00:25:58.160 --> 00:26:02.660
and don't talk, don't negotiate, don't shout at each other,

00:26:02.740 --> 00:26:05.520
walk up to him and hit him on the head.

00:26:06.080 --> 00:26:09.340
And then the whole other side will collapse.

00:26:09.580 --> 00:26:13.660
Identify your worst habits,

00:26:13.760 --> 00:26:17.520
and attack them first.  It's a way to keep your vows.

00:26:18.320 --> 00:26:20.320
Next.

00:26:23.880 --> 00:26:29.220
.... by the way at my age,

00:26:29.220 --> 00:26:32.320
I'm not saying how old I am,

00:26:32.320 --> 00:26:35.760
but all this young love is

00:26:35.760 --> 00:26:38.640
so ridiculous from my age perspective.

00:26:40.960 --> 00:26:43.360
I can say that with experience because I have it.

00:26:44.960 --> 00:26:46.880
But this thing about,

00:26:46.880 --> 00:26:49.359
oh, she's the most beautiful woman in the world.

00:26:50.000 --> 00:26:52.000
He is the most handsome man in the world.

00:26:53.040 --> 00:26:58.160
First of all, my oldest brother,

00:26:58.160 --> 00:27:01.440
he said the funniest thing.  He said, do you like that girl?  I said, yes.

00:27:02.080 --> 00:27:04.080
He said, you want to spend your life with him?  I said, yes.

00:27:04.640 --> 00:27:06.640
He said, check on his mother first.

00:27:07.679 --> 00:27:14.798
See what her mother looks like?  I said, Mom looks terrible.  He was overweight, he looked tired and he looked terrible.

00:27:15.440 --> 00:27:20.360
And he said, well, what do you think he used to look like,

00:27:20.720 --> 00:27:22.880
So think about this?

00:27:24.080 --> 00:27:28.160
If you are attached to someone's appearance,

00:27:28.880 --> 00:27:33.920
or something physical, or something less important about someone.

00:27:34.100 --> 00:27:39.620
It will change and you will see them get sick,

00:27:39.620 --> 00:27:42.680
you will see them get old.  You will see them having diarrhea and vomiting.

00:27:42.880 --> 00:27:46.720
If you are unlucky you will see them inside and in operation sometime.

00:27:47.600 --> 00:27:50.800
Don't fool yourself

00:27:51.760 --> 00:27:53.760
that it's worth hurting others

00:27:54.320 --> 00:27:59.200
to get the most beautiful woman or man.  This is not worth it.

00:28:00.480 --> 00:28:07.199
This won't last long.  It's nice to have a relationship but have it for the right reasons.

00:28:07.840 --> 00:28:09.840
Next.

00:28:11.520 --> 00:28:13.759
If you have problems with anger

00:28:14.640 --> 00:28:16.640
or you get angry easily.

00:28:16.960 --> 00:28:19.600
Try fantasizing about giving this person

00:28:20.320 --> 00:28:24.080
something they would love to have.  This is called maitri,

00:28:24.799 --> 00:28:26.080
jampa,

00:28:26.080 --> 00:28:26.794
love.

00:28:26.800 --> 00:28:32.020
Fantasizing, trying to remember how good it would be to give someone...

00:28:32.560 --> 00:28:34.831
something they love, something they want.

00:28:34.840 --> 00:28:36.880
Try to have this attitude.

00:28:37.280 --> 00:28:40.720
If you don't feel friendly towards others

00:28:41.520 --> 00:28:44.419
then do some fantasy, which means meditating

00:28:45.520 --> 00:28:49.039
on giving them something they would really like.

00:28:49.679 --> 00:28:51.679
