Not for the oaths you take from others, in general.

00:36:22.560 --> 00:36:24.560
If you don't take vows

00:36:24.720 --> 00:36:27.199
from others, then it might be okay at home

00:36:27.920 --> 00:36:32.600
to confess in front of a Buddha statue or something like that, in extreme cases it's okay.

